summary: Test NVIDIA driver installation
description: |
  Verify that NVIDIA installation selects matching driver packages and
  kernel modules while unversioned companion packages use their latest
  versions. Use mock RPMs to exercise package selection and dependency
  resolution without requiring NVIDIA hardware or functional drivers.
environment+:
  RADII: radii
require:
  - dnf-plugins-core
  - type: library
    nick: radii
    name: /Library/mock-rpms

/bare:
  summary+: ' (bare)'
  description+: |
    Installing nvidia without a version should select the latest stack.

/version:
  summary+: ' (explicit version)'
  description+: |
    Requesting an older driver version should select that stack even when
    a newer version is available.
  environment+:
    RADII_DRIVER: nvidia:580.178.04
    RADII_DRIVER_VERSION: 580.178.04
